---
title: "accrue_interest (Scallop Lend: Borrowing)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_time: time_elapsed = current_time - last_accrual_time
    q_check_time --> [*]: time_elapsed == 0, return (no-op)
    q_check_time --> q_calc_utilization: time_elapsed > 0
    q_calc_utilization --> q_calc_rate: utilization = total_borrowed / (total_supplied + total_borrowed)
    q_calc_rate --> q_trilinear: borrow_rate = trilinear_rate(utilization)
    q_trilinear --> q_calc_interest: interest_factor = borrow_rate * time_elapsed
    q_calc_interest --> q_update_debt: for each debt in obligation, debt *= (1 + interest_factor)
    q_update_debt --> q_update_pool: asset_pool.accumulated_interest += new_interest
    q_update_pool --> q_update_time: last_accrual_time = current_time
    q_update_time --> [*]: return

    note right of q_trilinear
        INV-001: Trilinear model has 3 kink points (unlike Compound dual-line)
        INV-002: Rate increases sharply as utilization approaches upper limit
        INV-003: borrow_rate >= 0 for all utilization levels
    end note

    note right of q_update_debt
        INV-004: Interest accrual is idempotent for same timestamp
        INV-005: Interest compounds on existing debt (including previously accrued interest)
        INV-006: 0 <= utilization <= 1
    end note
